Here is a simple and efficient JavaScript function to find the biggest number in an array.

### The Function

```javascript
function findBiggestNumber(arr) {
  // Check if the array is empty
  if (arr.length === 0) {
    throw new Error("Array cannot be empty");
  }

  // Initialize the biggest number with the first element
  let biggest = arr[0];

  // Loop through the rest of the array
  for (let i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {
    if (arr[i] > biggest) {
      biggest = arr[i];
    }
  }

  return biggest;
}
```

